WOODY BLOCK, a Fun yet addictive block puzzle game with warm relaxing style. It’s challenging entertaining, and requires your concentration but stress less, and is designed JUST FOR YOU!

WOODY BLOCK highlights：
- Relaxing & Addictive
- 10x10 WOODEN PUZZLE
- Easy to get started, hard to become a master;
- No time limit; take your time with the block puzzles
- Wi-Fi free; you can still enjoy WOODY BLOCK while offline;

WOODY BLOCK how to play：
	•	Move the Wooden Blocks onto the board;
	•	Rotate the blocks vertically & horizontally to smash them;
	•	The level is failed once you can’t place any blocks on the board
	•	Try your BEST to match as many Blocks as you can!


Woody Block：Puzzle Games can be your first choice to relax and boost your brain in daily life. Give it a shot, play this WOODY BLOCK puzzle game with your families in leisure time and get close to each other!
